      "paragraphs": [
        "- [ ] You can maintain equal counts for all four phases",
        "- [ ] Your transitions between phases are seamless",
        "- [ ] You stay relaxed during empty-lung holds",
        "- [ ] You maintain the whisper sound throughout",
        "- [ ] You can extend the count duration while staying comfortable"
      ]
