        "(Note: it could take hours of practice to perfect these techniques as they are taught. But it will happen. And when it does, you'll have a sophisticated toolkit for addressing even your most stubborn areas of tension. Keep in mind, though, your health is your responsibility! I'm a passionate yoga teacher, not a doctor. Nothing I say constitutes as medical advice. Please consult your physician before starting new health protocols.)"
